# Nothing is required: Claude runs through `claude -p`, GPT through `codex exec`, browsers and open-weight models on
# Modal (`modal token new`). Optional:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=        fallback route for the Claude models when the claude CLI is unavailable
# RLENV_PROXY=              proxy for every browser (Chromium --proxy-server), e.g. http://host:3128
# RLENV_LOCAL_BROWSER=1     run browsers locally (Chrome + browser-harness-js on PATH) instead of on Modal
